sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as App (EventCard / DetailsTab)
  participant Q as lib/query cache
  participant V as Vercel api/forecast.ts (Edge cache)
  participant NWS as api.weather.gov
  App->>App: outdoor (sand/grass) + lat/lng + starts within 7 days?
  App->>Q: useForecast(round(lat,2), round(lng,2)) — key shared by every event at that court
  alt cached < 30 min
    Q-->>App: hourly series
  else stale / missing
    Q->>V: GET {WEB_ORIGIN}/api/forecast?lat=30.27&lng=-97.77
    alt CDN hit (s-maxage=1800)
      V-->>Q: hourly JSON
    else miss
      V->>NWS: GET /points/30.27,-97.77 (User-Agent: vteam + contact)
      NWS-->>V: forecastHourly URL (grid cached 24h in the response key)
      V->>NWS: GET /gridpoints/EWX/x,y/forecast/hourly
      NWS-->>V: 156 hourly periods
      V-->>Q: trimmed {time, tempF, pop, windMph, short, rh}[] (7 days)
    end
  end
  App->>App: pickForecastHours(series, start, duration) → chip / row<br/>heatIndex() ≥ 95°F or rain ≥ 40% → warning style
  Note over V,NWS: NWS error / outside US → 204, row hidden. No database, no secrets.
